{{wikipedia|Moran}}
==English==

===Etymology===
There are two alternatives for the family name:
* Variant of the English and {{etyl|fr|en}} surname [[Morant]] , of unknown origin ([[morant]] "cubic" has been suggested).
* Anglicization of {{etyl|ga|en}} {{term|Ó Mórain||descendant of a person named Big|lang=ga}} or {{term|Ó Mughráin|lang=ga}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{surname|from=Old French|dot=}} of {{etyl|fro}} origin.
# {{surname|from=Irish|dot=}} of Irish origin.
# Any of a number of places in the USA named after persons with the surname.

